    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, wave based zombie shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the current features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 equipment items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon customization (skins/colours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to import custom weapon skins (only available for some guns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wielding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main maps + 2 seasonal maps + 3 extra maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 normal enemy types + 1 seasonal one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboard</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, wave based zombie shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the current features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 equipment items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon customization (skins/colours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to import custom weapon skins (only available for some guns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wielding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main maps + 2 seasonal maps + 3 extra maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 normal enemy types + 1 seasonal one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboard</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "No it is in no way related to Nex's UZG. We know about one another tho. UZG is a fast paced wave based zombie shooter game. There isn't much more to say about it. Similar in movement to Quake/Half-Life.",
